  "description": "Years of production: 2019-2021\n\nPreceded by the Flare Gen1. See the current Flare.\n\nThe second generation Flare was our 27.5\" wheel, light and lively steel full suspension trail bike. It combined the DNA of our Rocket enduro bike with the light, agile, subtle feel of our legendary Soul for a fun, fast, endlessly addictive ride, with a UK-made Reynolds 853 front triangle.\n\nAt heart it was a technical trail tearaway: lighter and easier to move around than our MAX 29ers, more compact than the enduro-focused Rocket, and with droplink suspension bringing more capability than our hardtails. It ducked and weaved, popped and wheelied, and scrabbled in and out of the tightest spaces. Optimised around 140mm forks with Longshot geometry, it flowed down singletrack, climbed beautifully, and gave confidence and pin-sharp accuracy in bigger, steeper terrain.\n\nFinishes: Gloss Black (with silver painted graphics) and Gloss Green.\nSizes: Small, Medium and Large. Wheels: 27.5\". Rear travel: 125mm, or 135mm from 2020.",
